{
    "title": "Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera",
    "description": "Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace) is a comprehensive beauty camera and photo/video editing app that meets all your needs. With the help of Beauty Camera \u2013 Sweet Snap, you can make every moment more special. Beauty Camera & Sweet Camera is packed with professional editing tools and various effects to enhance your selfies. \ud83d\udcf7\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (Beauty Face Makeup Camera) is its collection of amazing and beautiful color filters, ideal for daily selfies. The beauty face camera function also helps you achieve flawless and clean skin, using natural beauty camera beauty techniques. \ud83d\udcaf\r\n\r\nFurthermore, this app allows you to beautify your selfies with just one tap. You can whiten your teeth, smoothen your skin, and reshape your face effortlessly. With its adjusting tools, taking your selfie to the next level has never been easier. \ud83c\udf80\r\n\r\nBeauty Face Camera - Selfie Beauty Camera (BeautyFace) provides numerous photo editing tools, such as face retouch, photo effects, camera filters, amazing collages, fonts, stickers, frames, and animated effects. You can unleash your creativity, snap wonderful pictures, and effortlessly share them on popular platforms like YouTube, WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook,  Snapchat, TikTok and Twitter using the Beauty Camera. \r\n\r\nKey Features of Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace):\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83e\uddb0 <b> Beauty Touch-up, Beauty Camera, Face Tune </b>\r\n* Beautify: Apply beauty filters instantly to make your selfie photos more gorgeous.\r\n* HD Retouch: HD Retouch function allows you to tap once to achieve a more natural and stunning selfie.\r\n* Smooth: Smooth tool helps to refine your pores and smoothen your skin for a perfect complexion.\r\n* Reshape: Reshape tool enables you to touch-up your eyes, nose, lips, and more.\r\n* Eyes: Enlarge and brighten your eyes, and remove dark circles with the Eyes feature.\r\n* Teeth Whitening: Teeth whitening function brings out the natural beauty in your smile.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc70\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <b> Light Makeup Looks Make You A Superstar </b>\r\n* Preset light makeups automatically detect your face, showing makeup effects in real-time.\r\n* Perfect for beginners who are not familiar with eye, face, or lip cosmetics.\r\n* Enables you to try the latest makeup trends in a second.\r\n\r\n\u2702\ufe0f <b> Professional Photo Editor - Selfie Photo Editor </b>\r\n* Essential blur photo editor with advanced blur photo brush.\r\n* Crop photo editor allows easy resizing and trimming for the perfect selfie.\r\n* Background Changer lets you change the shape of your background.\r\n* Other features include brightness, contrast, vignette, fade, temperature, saturation, sharpen, etc.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc66\u200d\ud83d\udc67 <b> Amazing Collages, Frames & Effects for Collage Maker & Photo Grid </b>\r\n* Instantly remix selected photos into a cool collage using free preset templates and layouts.\r\n* Edit collage with filters, background, stickers, text, and more.\r\n\r\nDownload Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace) now and experience the best sweet selfie and selfie photo editing app. Capture, edit, share, and enjoy your life!  \ud83d\udc9d\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace) is not affiliated, associated, sponsored, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with YouTube, WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, , Snapchat, TikTok, Twitter.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace) is a comprehensive beauty camera and photo/video editing app that meets all your needs. With the help of Beauty Camera \u2013 Sweet Snap, you can make every moment more special. Beauty Camera &amp; Sweet Camera is packed with professional editing tools and various effects to enhance your selfies. \ud83d\udcf7<br><br>One of the standout features of Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (Beauty Face Makeup Camera) is its collection of amazing and beautiful color filters, ideal for daily selfies. The beauty face camera function also helps you achieve flawless and clean skin, using natural beauty camera beauty techniques. \ud83d\udcaf<br><br>Furthermore, this app allows you to beautify your selfies with just one tap. You can whiten your teeth, smoothen your skin, and reshape your face effortlessly. With its adjusting tools, taking your selfie to the next level has never been easier. \ud83c\udf80<br><br>Beauty Face Camera - Selfie Beauty Camera (BeautyFace) provides numerous photo editing tools, such as face retouch, photo effects, camera filters, amazing collages, fonts, stickers, frames, and animated effects. You can unleash your creativity, snap wonderful pictures, and effortlessly share them on popular platforms like YouTube, WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook,  Snapchat, TikTok and Twitter using the Beauty Camera. <br><br>Key Features of Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace):<br><br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83e\uddb0 <b> Beauty Touch-up, Beauty Camera, Face Tune </b><br>* Beautify: Apply beauty filters instantly to make your selfie photos more gorgeous.<br>* HD Retouch: HD Retouch function allows you to tap once to achieve a more natural and stunning selfie.<br>* Smooth: Smooth tool helps to refine your pores and smoothen your skin for a perfect complexion.<br>* Reshape: Reshape tool enables you to touch-up your eyes, nose, lips, and more.<br>* Eyes: Enlarge and brighten your eyes, and remove dark circles with the Eyes feature.<br>* Teeth Whitening: Teeth whitening function brings out the natural beauty in your smile.<br><br>\ud83d\udc70\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <b> Light Makeup Looks Make You A Superstar </b><br>* Preset light makeups automatically detect your face, showing makeup effects in real-time.<br>* Perfect for beginners who are not familiar with eye, face, or lip cosmetics.<br>* Enables you to try the latest makeup trends in a second.<br><br>\u2702\ufe0f <b> Professional Photo Editor - Selfie Photo Editor </b><br>* Essential blur photo editor with advanced blur photo brush.<br>* Crop photo editor allows easy resizing and trimming for the perfect selfie.<br>* Background Changer lets you change the shape of your background.<br>* Other features include brightness, contrast, vignette, fade, temperature, saturation, sharpen, etc.<br><br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc66\u200d\ud83d\udc67 <b> Amazing Collages, Frames &amp; Effects for Collage Maker &amp; Photo Grid </b><br>* Instantly remix selected photos into a cool collage using free preset templates and layouts.<br>* Edit collage with filters, background, stickers, text, and more.<br><br>Download Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace) now and experience the best sweet selfie and selfie photo editing app. Capture, edit, share, and enjoy your life!  \ud83d\udc9d<br><br>Disclaimer: Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera (ButyFace) is not affiliated, associated, sponsored, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with YouTube, WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, , Snapchat, TikTok, Twitter.",
